WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.193
"Adrenal Fatigue: What It Is and How to Treat It"

00:00:07.236 --> 00:00:10.080
Many seeking treatment
for common nonspecific symptoms

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.580
are led to believe
they are suffering

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.860
from some sort
of hormonal deficiency.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.180
"Adrenal fatigue"
is the prototypical example.

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.000
Chiropractor-coined in 1998,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.640
the invented diagnosis
has since been embraced

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.740
by naturopaths,
functional medicine,

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.480
and anti-aging doctors.

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:31.440
But does adrenal fatigue
even exist?

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:36.000
The alleged condition is said
to result from chronic stress

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.060
leading to an "overuse"
of the adrenal glands

00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:41.040
and their eventual
functional decline.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:45.360
Symptoms supposedly include
fatigue, body aches,

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:46.980
sleep issues,
and digestive problems,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.140
at least
according to the websites

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.720
not so coincidentally selling
a suite of supplements

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:52.620
to remedy it.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.960
It will come as no surprise

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.520
that the originator
of the term

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:58.380
sells supplements
on his website

00:00:58.380 --> 00:01:00.480
to treat it
for $200 a month.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:04.680
But it may not be
an actual medical condition.

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.460
The symptoms people have
are real,

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:11.520
but they just may be caused
by something else,

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.860
for example, sleep apnea,
chronic fatigue syndrome,

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:14.940
or fibromyalgia.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:19.200
Saliva tests for adrenal
hormone levels are not reliable,

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.080
with studies showing so-called
"adrenal fatigue" patients

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:23.520
having higher levels
than controls,

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.560
similar levels,
or lower levels,

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.740
"an almost systematic finding
of conflicting results."

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.660
There is an actual disease
of adrenal insufficiency

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:35.160
known as Addison's disease,

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:39.060
which is diagnosed
with an ACTH stimulation test.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:42.540
You inject people with
adrenocorticotropic hormone,

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:45.360
the signal your brain uses
to get your adrenal glands

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.520
to pump out
the stress hormone cortisol,

00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:49.620
and if your adrenals
don't respond,

00:01:49.620 --> 00:01:52.140
that shows your adrenal glands
must be in trouble.

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.840
But inject those
presumed to be suffering

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.780
from chronic stress and fatigue
with ACTH

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.840
and sometimes you even get
a greater rise in cortisol,

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.580
disproving the notion

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.460
that stress causes
the adrenals to "burn out."

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.900
But wait,
you were diagnosed with "AF,"

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.840
given corticosteroids,
and now you feel great,

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.400
so it must have been real.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.700
That's the thing
about corticosteroids, though.

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:21.000
One of the side effects is
a euphoric sense of well-being.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.460
The problem is
that even low doses

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.260
can increase the risk
of osteoporosis,

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:28.740
psychiatric and metabolic
disorders, muscle damage,

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:32.400
glaucoma, sleep disturbances,
and cardiovascular diseases.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:37.260
But wait, you took some
"adrenal support" supplements,

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:38.460
checked the labels,

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:40.380
confirmed they don't have
any hormones,

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:41.880
and still felt better.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:45.060
They lie.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.840
Researchers checked the 12 most
popular adrenal support supplements,

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:52.380
and every single one
contained hidden hormones,

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:55.260
none of which were declared
on the product labels.

00:02:55.260 --> 00:02:57.240
All contained thyroid hormone

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.280
and most a steroid hormone
as well,

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:04.080
pregnenolone, budesonide,
androstenedione, progesterone,

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.700
cortisone, or cortisol.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:09.540
Adrenal fatigue reminds me
of what used to be called

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.760
"electromagnetic
hypersensitivity,"

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:13.620
now referred to
in the medical literature

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.900
as "idiopathic
environmental intolerance

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:18.960
attributed to
electromagnetic fields,"

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:22.080
unspecific symptoms
supposedly triggered

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:23.820
by things like cell phones.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:25.740
There have been
at least 46 studies

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:28.980
involving more than 1,000 people
that claim to be affected,

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.980
yet when put to the test
in blinded trials

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.680
the studies
near universally failed

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.140
to show that anyone
could even detect the fields.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:41.220
Why don't journalists covering
these stories mention the data?

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:43.800
Because there are
snake-oil salesmen

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.540
profiting off
the perceived condition,

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.060
selling all matter of
so-called "protective" gadgets

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:50.040
that viciously attack anyone

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.140
even daring to mention
the science,

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:54.540
accusing them
of denying the reality

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:55.380
of people's symptoms.

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:58.200
But it's arguably the opposite.

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.200
They are the ones
hindering sufferers

00:04:01.200 --> 00:04:02.890
from getting to the bottom
of what is actually causing

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:04.140
their symptoms.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.960
Similarly, hawking
unproven tests and treatments

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.480
for adrenal fatigue
could delay the diagnosis

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:12.420
of a real, treatable condition.

